cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "Tahoe Explorer: a Shiny app for exploring Tahoe-100M metadata"
abstract: >-
  A Shiny application for exploring the metadata of the Tahoe-100M single-cell
  perturbation dataset. It summarizes drug, cell-line, sample, gene, and
  cell-level metadata in interactive charts, and assembles a filtered subset
  together with a reproducible R and Python pull recipe to plan downstream
  analysis. The cell-level observation table is queried lazily with duckdb, so
  the app runs without loading the full table into memory.
